/-- **The deck sum is a level-6 expansion**: summing any quantity over
the seven decks gives seven times its density-weighted sum over the
six-vertex classes. -/
theorem sum_deckClass (f : FlagWithSize TetraFree emptyType 6 → ℚ) {m : ℕ}
